this shouldn't surprise you at this  point but heather josh and the other  stars of the blair witch films didn't  really die some launched careers in  hollywood while others have turned their  back on the business here's what  happened to the cast of the blair witch  movies  she's the most recognizable face of the  blair witch franchise and that's not  necessarily a good thing as heather  donahue sadly admitted to the guardian  in 2016 my name and face are forever  going to be someone else's intellectual  property this is what happened when she  shot to stardom playing herself as the  film's lead blair witch believer and  documentarian investigator while she  said that making the film was a joy  immediate success afterwards was elusive  especially as the marketing team at  artisan entertainment wanted her to act  as though she were really dead for a  long time her imdb profile listed her as  deceased at age 24. this confusion about  her mortality status didn't help land  her many subsequent roles but she did  manage to carve out parts in a dozen or  so movies later before calling it quits  on hollywood in 2007. her next move was  to the sierra nevada foothills where she  became a grower of medical marijuana  donahue's high times became the basis  for her green memoir grow girl which was  published in 2012. she then co-created  and tried to shop around a pot comedy  pilot called the high country these days  donahue is currently focused on  developing a line of herbal skincare  products and inspiring and teaching  others to share their own stories  through writing  josh leonard told the guardian back in  2018 i was up for any kind of adventure  back then so said yes when directors  daniel myrick and eduardo sanchez asked  me to play the cameraman leonard also  experienced troubles being listed as  deceased on imdb by the artisan  marketing department to the point that  his parents started getting condolence  calls in response to the fake news his  career came very much alive after the  film and he decided to earnestly pursue  the craft of acting and stop quote being  the guy from blair witch a year later he  appeared opposite robert de niro and  cuba gooding jr in men of honor followed  by a steady diet of independent films  network tv shows and video game  voiceovers  inspired by his work in lynn shelton's  improvised 2009 mumblecore film hump day  he branched out as a director with  2011's the lie and later with 2018 stark  was the knight and 2020s fully realized  humans leonard continues to be a working  actor in projects like steven  soderbergh's 2018 iphone horror flick on  sane and tv series including bates motel  and togetherness he has been married to  fellow actor alison pill since 2015.  michael williams is a very common name  but the bronx-born sometimes actor knows  you know him better as mike aka the map  guy aka the guy in the corner from the  blair witch project he extended his  resume by guesting on a few tv shows  like law order and fbi as well as  reuniting with director eduardo sanchez  for his 2006 horror film altered  williams enlisted sanchez and his witch  co-star joshua leonard for the 2013 web  series four corners of fear while he  does have a few new projects on the  horizon williams has moved away from  having a full-time career as an actor he  currently works as a school counselor is  an adjunct faculty member at the jacob  burns media arts lab and runs the mcw  acting studio alongside his wife tony  williams is currently writing a book  about his debut film with the working  title escaping the most famous corner in  hollywood how he survived the blair  witch in his free time he enjoys fishing  in the great outdoors  ed swanson isn't much of a fisherman nor  an actor but he played up both in the  blair witch project as our trio of  filmmakers headed deep into the woods  swanson was on director eduardo  sanchez's softball team and was asked to  play a part in the movie besides that  performance swanson hasn't acted outside  of community and church theater he was  in the marine corps and got out right  before the gulf war this brought him to  maryland where the film was shot and he  still resides there to this day now in  his 50s he's carved out a niche for  himself as an artisan who creates clocks  as for his fishing buddy with the hat in  the film bob griffin he had never met  him before the film nor saw him after  according to swanson his scene partner  has since passed away  susie gooch was in the right place at  the right time when she and her young  daughter ingrid were interviewed for  what they thought was an actual student  film they didn't think much about their  ad-lib lines until a friend two years  later said they'd seen them in a movie  called the blair witch project where  susie was listed in the credits as  jackie hallx the non-acting natural  ladies relished their roles in the film  and have happily appeared at screenings  and filming location tours in the years  since susie has been a teacher for over  34 years and currently works as a tutor  in maryland ingrid graduated from hood  college with a master's of science in  clinical mental health counseling is  currently the lead clinician at an  outpatient recovery center is a big corn  fan and is engaged to be married  attempting to capitalize on the hoopla  behind the blair witch project a  quasi-sequel book of shadows blair witch  2 hit theaters a year later launching a  filming location's tour of the first  film within this film led by jeffrey  patterson patterson was played by  jeffrey donovan who knew the risks of  alienating fans of the original by  outright saying it was pure fiction fans  and critics didn't care for this  approach but it had little effect on  donovan's career his acting visibility  started to pick up steam when he  appeared in the 2005 will smith vehicle  hitch and two years later he landed a  stint on tv's crossing jordan leading  man's status was achieved when he got  noticed as michael weston in usa  network's burn notice in between he  played robert f kennedy and clint  eastwood's j edgar and later his brother  john f and rob reiner's lbj other works  of notes include season two of fargo  playing opposite angelina jolie in  eastwood's changeling and in lucy in the  sky alongside natalie portman  when kim director heard about a blair  witch sequel she was skeptical at first  but hit the floor when she found out she  was going to be directed by acclaimed  paradise lost documentarian joe  burlinger she described her psychic king  diamond character in book of shadows as  a very intuitive slightly depressed  acidic goth girl director feels the  follow-up didn't do well because of poor  marketing and that it ultimately had a  lot that it had to fight against i  thought the movie was cool despite its  failure book of shadows was a breakout  role for director actually her fourth  one after securing small parts in the  spike lee films he got game summer of  sam and bamboozled she reunited with lee  in 2004 where she hate me 2006 is inside  man and the netflix series version of  she's gotta have it outside of her  league collaborations she is kept busy  with other films as well as appearances  in notable shows like sex in the city  law and order oranges the new black the  good wife and gotham one of her larger  more memorable recent roles was as the  sex worker shea on hbo's the deuce  2016's blair witch was more of a true  sequel to the original than book of  shadows it finds heather's younger  brother james heading into those same  scary woods to try and find his sister  mccoon told digital trends there was a  lot of pressure to live up to the  standards of the first one the film  literally gave him nightmares and in  2016 he told usa today i had dreams of  being chased by a creature down an  alleyway on a regular basis i'd have  dreams of being ripped apart  mccoon is no stranger to nightmare as  having appeared in 11 episodes of the  walking dead as farmhand jimmy he's also  made appearances on series such as  shameless homeland and how to get away  with murder in films he's appeared  opposite the rock and snitch and had a  role in mary herron's tragic lifetime  movie anna nicole recently he has also  added the roles of producer and  assistant director to his profile having  worked on the web series sugarpine 7 and  the short film taipei jesus  lisa arlington wanted to make a  documentary called the absence of  closure including the story of heather  donahue's brother and her boyfriend  james and even launched a kickstarter to  help her make it a reality in actual  reality lisa arlington was played by  cali hernandez who had a weirdly fun  time working on the third witch film's  memorable dirty tunnel scene in an  interview with slash film she recalled  having a better time handling the close  quarters than the claustrophobic camera  guy did hernandez's acting career didn't  start until her early 20s but when it  did it started with a bang landing a  role that was later cut in terrence  malik's song to song that was followed  by a trio of parts and robert rodriguez  projects including machete kills while  shooting blair witch in vancouver she  made a singing tape that led to her  playing one of emma stone's roommates in  la la land her credits also include  ridley scott's alien covenant tv's  graves and under the silver lake next on  her dance card is joining jennifer lopez  and josh demelle for shotgun wedding  peter is james's skeptical childhood  friend in the 3rd blair witch film and  is played by tuscaloosa native brandon  scott scott told his hometown newspaper  that 2016's blair witch is more of an  homage to the first one but it takes the  story to the nth degree even though it  leaves a lot of easter eggs and open  questions a graduate of new york  university's tisch school of the arts in  2004 scott has racked up north of 70  credits since leaving school his voice  was heard in disney's wreck-it ralph in  the boss baby tv series and he's been  seen in everything from showtime's  gorilla to this is us to dead to me in  goliath in a blair witch alumni pairing  scott played lucky and joshua leonard's  2018 directed feature dark was the  knight  corbin reed was definitely scared when  reading the script for blair witch for  which she was cast as ashley the poor  girl gets a nasty infection on her foot  during the journey which is one of the  last things you'd want in the deep dark  woods in real life reed was able to  escape the forest and nab 13 episode  stints on both how to get away with  murder and valor in 2019 she wrote  directed and executive produced the  short film blind site and she is  currently making waves starring on the  star series run the world the minnesotan  is an avid long-distance runner a lover  of puppies and interior design her dream  role is to play whitney houston  in the third blair witch film locals  lane and talia are conspiracy theorists  who found lost footage of heather  donahue taped to a tree in the woods  their find sets the plot in motion with  the two acting as guides for james and  his friends valerie curry who played  talia never saw the original when she  was younger telling vogue i was  terrified of e.t as a small child i had  a low threshold for fear curry's early  acting career began with six episodes of  veronica mars but she took a break soon  after to see if another vocation would  stick and it didn't she returned to the  craft in 2011 with parts on csi new york  psych the twilight saga breaking dawn  part 2 and even appearing in blink 182's  music video for the song after midnight  her residency on the show the following  not only earned her steady paycheck but  it was also where she met her future  husband actor sam underwood the two have  since acted together in a pair of short  films at the edinburgh fringe festival  and even perform music together live  other notable works include playing cara  on the video game detroit become human  and appearing in the tick tv series  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite horror movies are coming  soon subscribe to our youtube channel  and hit the bell so you don't miss a  single one  [Music]

